{
  "id": "r3-eighths",
  "title": "Eighth notes",
  "summary": "Two notes to every beat.",
  "requires": {
    "pitchStage": "P3",
    "rhythmStage": "R3"
  },
  "introduces": {
    "rhythms": ["8"]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "type": "explain",
      "title": "Two to a beat",
      "text": [
        "An **eighth note** lasts half a beat, so two fit in one beat. Pairs are joined by a **beam**.",
        "Count **1 and 2 and**: play on the number, and again on the **and**."
      ],
      "score": {
        "key": "C",
        "time": "4/4",
        "position": 0,
        "bars": ["B4/8 B4/8 B4/8 B4/8 B4/q B4/q"]
      },
      "fingering": "none",
      "labels": [
        {
          "bar": 1,
          "note": 1,
          "text": "1"
        },
        {
          "bar": 1,
          "note": 2,
          "text": "and"
        },
        {
          "bar": 1,
          "note": 3,
          "text": "2"
        },
        {
          "bar": 1,
          "note": 4,
          "text": "and"
        },
        {
          "bar": 1,
          "note": 5,
          "text": "3"
        },
        {
          "bar": 1,
          "note": 6,
          "text": "4"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "explain",
      "title": "Keep the beat where it was",
      "text": [
        "With a pick, play down on the number and up on the **and**. With fingers, alternate two fingers.",
        "The clicks do not speed up. Eighth notes are twice as many, not rushed."
      ],
      "score": {
        "key": "C",
        "time": "4/4",
        "position": 0,
        "bars": ["B4/q B4/8 B4/8 B4/q B4/8 B4/8"]
      },
      "fingering": "none"
    },
    {
      "type": "practice",
      "title": "Open strings",
      "text": ["Count **1 and 2 and 3 and 4 and** all the way through, even on the long notes."],
      "score": {
        "key": "C",
        "time": "4/4",
        "position": 0,
        "bars": [
          "G4/q G4/8 G4/8 B4/q B4/8 B4/8",
          "E5/8 E5/8 E5/8 E5/8 B4/h",
          "G4/8 G4/8 B4/8 B4/8 E5/q B4/q",
          "G4/w"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "check",
      "title": "Eighths on open strings",
      "text": ["Keep the count even."],
      "score": {
